---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import Skyline from '../components/Skyline.astro';
import { business, telHref } from '../data/business';
---
<Base title="Thank you | Alter Phase Roofing" description="We received your request." path="/thank-you/" noindex>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="wrap" style="grid-template-columns:1fr">
      <div style="max-width:760px">
        <span class="eyebrow" style="color:var(--gold-400)">Request received</span>
        <h1>Thank you. We'll call you shortly.</h1>
        <p class="lead">We usually call back within the hour during business hours (Mon–Fri 8–8, Sat 8–5). If water is coming in right now, please call us instead.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions"><a class="btn btn-gold btn-lg" href={telHref}><Icon name="phone" /> Call {business.phone}</a></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <Skyline />
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap-narrow prose">
      <h2>What happens next</h2>
      <ol>
        <li><strong>We call you</strong> to hear what's going on and set a time to visit.</li>
        <li><strong>We inspect your roof in person</strong> and take photos so you can see what we see.</li>
        <li><strong>You get a written estimate</strong> with clear options. No pressure, no obligation.</li>
      </ol>
      <p>While you wait, you might find these useful: <a href="/roof-replacement-guide-nyc/">our NYC roof replacement guide</a> and <a href="/roofing-costs-in-nyc/">what roofing costs in NYC</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <script is:inline>window.dataLayer = window.dataLayer || []; window.dataLayer.push({ event: 'thank_you_view' });</script>
</Base>
